# core.autocrlf=true on the Windows workstations rewrites checkouts to CRLF.
# For shell scripts that is not cosmetic: a `#!/usr/bin/env bash\r` shebang and
# `set -euo pipefail\r` fail outright on Linux, and these scripts are meant to
# run on the game host. CLAUDE.md already requires LF everywhere; this makes
# git enforce it instead of relying on every tool behaving.
*.sh text eol=lf
